# LeakSanitizer suppressions for third-party library caches.
#
# fontconfig keeps its config and pattern caches for the life of the
# process (Pango loads it to render titles and menus). Keep this list
# narrow: a pattern matches any frame of the allocation stack, so
# suppressing e.g. libcairo would also hide fluxland's own leaks.
leak:libfontconfig.so

# Integration test clients don't destroy every wl_proxy they create.
# The compositor doesn't link libwayland-client, so this can't hide
# compositor leaks.
leak:libwayland-client.so
